        "description": {
          "text": "Updated Use in Specific Populations, adding Pregnancy Testing and pediatric study results to the Pediatric Use subsections",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for revisions to the Use in Specific Populations section, including the addition of \u201cPregnancy Testing\u201d under Females and Males of Reproductive Potential subsection and updates to the Pediatric Use subsections of the package insert (PI) to include the results from pediatric studies as part of the December 4, 2000, original Written Request for pediatric studies for Yondelis (trabectedin), our subsequent July 2, 2002, May 19, 2004, October 4, 2010, March 15, 2012, July 31, 2017, amended Written Request letters and, our November 7, 2017, reissued Written Request letter.",
